{"id":175,"flavor":[{"games":["Legends: Arceus"],"text":"This ovate creature is frequently mistaken for a moving egg when encountered out in the fields or in the mountains. Its guileless smile soothes the soul."},{"games":["Shield","Crystal"],"text":"It is considered to be a symbol of good luck. Its shell is said to be filled with happiness."},{"games":["Sword","X","HeartGold","LeafGreen","Gold"],"text":"The shell seems to be filled with joy. It is said that it will share good luck when treated kindly."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Omega Ruby","Sapphire","Ruby"],"text":"As its energy, Togepi uses the positive emotions of compassion and pleasure exuded by people and Pokémon. This Pokémon stores up feelings of happiness inside its shell, then shares them with others."},{"games":["Y","SoulSilver","FireRed","Silver"],"text":"A proverb claims that happiness will come to anyone who can make a sleeping Togepi stand up."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum"],"text":"It transforms the kindness and joy of others into happiness, which it stores in its shell."},{"games":["Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"Its shell is said to be stuffed with happiness that it shares with kindhearted people."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"As its energy, it uses the feelings of compassion and pleasure exuded by people and POKéMON. It stores up happy feelings in its shell, then shares them out."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Hustle","hidden":false,"description":"Boosts the Pokémon's Attack stat but lowers its accuracy."},{"name":"Serene Grace","hidden":false,"description":"Raises the likelihood of additional effects occurring when the Pokémon uses its moves."},{"name":"Super Luck","hidden":true,"description":"The Pokémon is so lucky that the critical-hit ratios of its moves are boosted."}],"eggGroups":["Undiscovered"],"genderRate":1,"hatchCounter":10,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"fast","habitat":"forest","color":"White","shape":"Humanoid","evolution":{"id":175,"name":"Togepi","condition"